Machines bank the experience their work gives as Liquid Experience, 20 mB a point, in a tank of their own:
- the Induction Furnace and its Array: the experience of what they smelt and sinter;
- the Arcforge Furnace: its alloys, steel, silicon and graphite;
- the Block Breaker: what the blocks it breaks drop (ores, mostly).
